This repository holds no legal text: building it is paused until the Government of Tuvalu gives permission. The
official Tuvalu Legislation site (https://www.tuvalu-legislation.tv) says a user "may not transmit, distribute or
commercialise the material without the permission of the Government of Tuvalu" (README.md).

Lexifina's own contributions (the documentation and the tables) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
